    {
      "text": "A diamond needs dark to sparkle.",
      "scene": {
        "kind": "photo",
        "src": "bridal-render.webp",
        "focus": {
          "x": 0.49,
          "y": 0.26,
          "k": 1.5
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Gem labs judge its look by three things, starting with brightness.",
      "scene": {
        "kind": "steps",
        "items": [
          "Brightness",
          "Fire",
          "Scintillation"
        ],
        "active": 0,
        "label": "How labs judge the look"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Fire is white light split into rainbow colors.",
      "scene": {
        "kind": "steps",
        "items": [
          "Brightness",
          "Fire",
          "Scintillation"
        ],
        "active": 1,
        "label": "How labs judge the look"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Scintillation is the sparkle, with its pattern of light and dark.",
      "say": "Sin-tih-lay-shun is the sparkle, with its pattern of light and dark.",
      "scene": {
        "kind": "photo",
        "src": "bridal-render.webp",
        "label": "Scintillation",
        "marks": [
          {
            "x": 0.46,
            "y": 0.21,
            "text": "Dark",
            "at": 0.5
          },
          {
            "x": 0.47,
            "y": 0.31,
            "text": "Bright",
            "at": 1.1
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "The dark parts are often reflections of your own head.",
      "scene": {
        "kind": "cast",
        "setting": "plain",
        "name": "Your reflection",
        "role": "The dark in a diamond",
        "cast": [
          {
            "outfit": "suit",
            "outfitColor": "#2a2f3d",
            "hair": "short",
            "hairColor": "#3a2c22",
            "skin": "#e2b08a",
            "glasses": "loupe",
            "prop": "gem",
            "expression": "focused"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "GIA and AGS both count that contrast when they judge a cut.",
      "say": "G I A and A G S both count that contrast when they judge a cut.",
      "scene": {
        "kind": "title",
        "text": "Contrast",
        "sub": "Counted by GIA and AGS"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "A jewelry render needs bright highlights and darker areas around the stone,",
      "scene": {
        "kind": "photo",
        "src": "mix585-render-top.webp",
        "label": "Dark and bright",
        "focus": {
          "x": 0.49,
          "y": 0.48,
          "k": 1.4
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "or the diamond turns white and plain instead of sparkly.",
      "scene": {
        "kind": "reveal",
        "item": "glass",
        "shape": "round",
        "tone": "#eef2f5",
        "openAt": 0.1,
        "label": "Even light only"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Photographers add small black cards outside the frame for the same reason.",
      "scene": {
        "kind": "title",
        "text": "Black cards",
        "sub": "Just out of frame"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Without dark contrast, a diamond loses its sparkle and looks flat.",
      "scene": {
        "kind": "photo",
        "src": "eternity-render.webp",
        "focus": {
          "x": 0.45,
          "y": 0.35,
          "k": 1.4
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "In this render even the smallest stones have dark and bright facets.",
      "scene": {
        "kind": "compare",
        "before": "bridal-cad.webp",
        "after": "bridal-render.webp"
      }
    }
